The '''Durkteel Loop''' was a [[hyperspace route]] in the intersection of the [[Mid Rim Territories]]<ref name="Collapse" /> and [[the Slice]] that passed through the [[Kashyyyk system]] in the [[Mytaranor sector]]<ref name="Collapse" /> then the [[Sneeve system]] and [[Durkteel system]]<ref name="YouTube" /> in the [[Kastolar sector]]<ref name="Kastolar" /> of the [[Kashyyyk Region]] before ending at junction onto the [[Pabol Sleheyron]] route.<ref name="YouTube" /> The Kashyyyk [[Star system|system]] acted as a junction onto the [[Great Kashyyyk Branch]], [[Nightroad]],<ref name="Collapse" /> and [[Randon Run]] hyperspace routes.<ref name="RO World Locations" />

